{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Theft Runner</strong> is a fast-paced runner game focused on pure reflexes and clean gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Selection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character selection is purely visual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running speed, jumping, sliding, and controls are identical for every character, keeping the experience fair and skill-based. Success depends on timing, focus, and player reflexes\u2014not character advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Unlock System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins during your runs to unlock characters with different colors and visual styles. All characters play the same\u2014the difference is purely cosmetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090940/extras/50771771d1a67016455556a1dabf8871.poster.avif?t=1767786081\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090940/extras/50771771d1a67016455556a1dabf8871.webm?t=1767786081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth and continuous runner mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing-based obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, reaction-driven escape moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, intense, and highly replayable runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Theft Runner is easy to learn and hard to master. Every run is a new attempt, and every mistake matters.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Same rules. Same speed. Only skill decides who escapes.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Keep that in your mind! The course of the game will continue to be shaped by your feedback.</i></strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The run has begun.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090940/5c8226774c804d46212740d6966664348e1ad0f3.jpg"},{"name":"25 Coins on the Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090940/03fa3b60f190e25849d4a199e32b6ded99d4bb86.jpg"},{"name":"50 Coins on the Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090940/cb5183a673f71a0a5b1cb0e16da7fbeb876813fa.jpg"},{"name":"75 Coins on the Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090940/6cfea1c7f5c1e80a3d17bfa8a14e46db2986fc21.jpg"},{"name":"King of Coins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090940/a61f05fb66612df4a51dc652312dc6f9cfde6561.jpg"},{"name":"Goat of Coins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090940/439bcca1c1897f29bec7e9f0bfbbdb6a584e6822.jpg"},{"name":"You crushed 500 meters.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090940/4cebc25247c63026de2e298d34d7d0e8701dc8ee.jpg"},{"name":"You crushed 750 meters.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090940/dfb0f28514631fc980ae9a60666549eb0af7b9b2.jpg"},{"name":"You crushed 1000 meters.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090940/c3291ca9a7aec83130724186de7118037159031d.jpg"},{"name":"You collected a magnet.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090940/7059888367956af1f9ab4e5a2c8135a98f0fef0e.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageb